// title: "High-speed rail build collections"
// summary: "Select named groups of existing reusable rail types for builds without creating additional pieces or placements."
//
// Used when: A contributor selects a named group with custom-pieces/scp.py build --set, inspects the available groups with list, or regenerates the catalogue.
// Read by: scp.catalog.load_catalog merges these memberships into piece_sets; custom-pieces/scp.py selection resolves --set, and scp.inventory.write_inventories displays the groups.
// Updated by: Maintainers author build selections, scp.registration.apply_registration records groups supplied by domain registration tools, and custom-pieces/domains/high-speed-rail/tools/apply_junction_review.py refreshes the saved review selections.
// Affects: Which existing piece IDs are selected together. A collection adds no geometry, permanent game IDs, assembly placements, or construction button; members must already exist in the domain registry.
// Reference: custom-pieces/docs/BUILD_AND_INSTALL.md.
